# Isi alamat back end jika sudah ada, contoh: https://api-anda.onrender.com
# Jika kosong, aplikasi memakai data CSV di public/data
VITE_API_URL=

# Kontrak API yang dipakai antarmuka:
# GET/POST /api/v1/batches
# PATCH /api/v1/batches/:batch_id
# GET/POST /api/v1/suppliers
# PATCH/DELETE /api/v1/suppliers/:supplier_id
# POST /api/v1/sales
# GET /api/v1/admin/sales-summary?from=YYYY-MM-DD&to=YYYY-MM-DD
# GET/POST /api/v1/employees
# PATCH/DELETE /api/v1/employees/:employee_id
# GET list mengembalikan array JSON. POST/PATCH mengembalikan satu objek resource.
# Batch input: product_id (opsional untuk produk baru), product_name, category,
# batch_number, current_stock (jumlah masuk), unit_price, received_at, expiry_date,
# supplier_id (opsional/null), supplier_name (opsional).
# Backend membangkitkan batch_id dan status/turunan tanggal kedaluwarsa.
# Supplier: supplier_id, name, contact_person, phone, email, address.
# Sale input: batch_id, quantity (integer), sold_at (YYYY-MM-DD).
# Backend memvalidasi stok batch dan menyimpan transaksi serta pengurangan stok
# secara konsisten sebelum mengembalikan respons sukses.
# Sales summary: revenue, transaction_count, quantity_sold for the requested period.
# Employee input: full_name, username, email, phone, role ("employee"), password (create only).
# Employee response: employee_id, full_name, username, email, phone, role, status.
# Backend must hash passwords and authorize these employee-management endpoints
# for authenticated admin users only.
